<title>AUSTRALIA: CRICKET-SHEFFIELD SHIELD SCORE.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-SHEFFIELD SHIELD SCORE.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1997-02-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Close of play score in the Sheffield Shield cricket competition on Wednesday.</p>
<p>In Hobart (day two): South Australia 387 all out (Ben Johnson 91, Joe Scuderi 70); Tasmania 136 for five (Ricky Ponting 76 not out).</p>
